# Requisições para a extensão "REST Client" do VS Code (ou o HTTP Client do JetBrains).
# Execute na ordem: o login guarda o token em {{token}} e a criação guarda o id em {{productId}}.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@email = aluno@teste.com
@password = SenhaForte123

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health

### Registro
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Aluno Teste", "email": "{{email}}", "password": "{{password}}" }

### Login
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{email}}", "password": "{{password}}" }

###
@token = {{login.response.body.token}}

### Quem sou eu
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Listar SEM token (espera 401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products

### Criar produto
# @name createProduct
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Caneta Azul", "sku": "can-001", "category": "Papelaria", "unitPrice": 2.5, "minStock": 5 }

###
@productId = {{createProduct.response.body.product.id}}

### Listar (com busca e estoque baixo)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products?search=caneta&lowStock=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Buscar por id
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/{{productId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Atualizar (enviar "quantity" aqui retorna 400)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/products/{{productId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Caneta Azul 0.7", "unitPrice": 2.9 }

### Entrada de 10
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products/{{productId}}/movements
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "type": "ENTRY", "quantity": 10, "note": "Compra inicial" }

### Saída de 3 (aceita)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products/{{productId}}/movements
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "type": "EXIT", "quantity": 3 }

### Saída de 50 (bloqueada: 422 INSUFFICIENT_STOCK)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products/{{productId}}/movements
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "type": "EXIT", "quantity": 50 }

### Histórico de movimentações
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/{{productId}}/movements
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Apagar produto (204)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/products/{{productId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
